758	/**
759	 * Close the bundle's review cycle if its entries allow it, and write the unsigned proposal. A cycle with
760	 * open findings stays open: fix or defer each (pantheon-review-cycle fix|defer --ledger <run ledger>),
761	 * then call this again (`pantheon-board.mjs propose --bundle DIR`). A cycle that closes `unverified` can
762	 * propose Resolved only with `acceptUnverified` (a stated reason, recorded). A cycle opened under the
763	 * practice contract also needs its practice assessment (audit C3): `practice` ({outcome, question, ...})
