826	/**
827	 * Full re-derivation of a proposal's evidence with Pantheon's kinds (status.mjs apply checks it only
828	 * structurally, since packages/ledger supplies no domain): the run ledger verifies and re-derives against
829	 * its anchor, the cycle closed with the stated outcome on the stated reviews, the commit exists, descends
830	 * from the cycle's base and its diff is the one the reviewers were given.
